# The build context is only entrypoint.sh, the three /usr/local/bin scripts,
# lib/ (the devaloy modules) and config/. The five devaloy-* names are gone from
# this list on purpose: they are symlinks the Dockerfile creates, not files.
# Everything else is dead weight sent to the daemon on every build —
# and worse, a change to any of it busts the context hash.
#
# This list is a whitelist, so a new file COPYed by the Dockerfile has to be
# added here too. Miss it and the build fails at the COPY with "not found",
# which reads like a typo in the Dockerfile rather than an omission here.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!bootstrap-toolchain.sh
!devaloy
!lib
!lib/**
!link-shims
!config
!config/**
